graph TD
    A[Health Monitor] --> B{Check Interval<br/>Every 30s}

    B --> C[Measure Latency]
    B --> D[Track Success Rate]
    B --> E[Monitor Uptime]
    B --> F[Check Connection State]

    C --> G{Latency Check}
    D --> H{Success Rate Check}
    E --> I{Uptime Check}
    F --> J{Connection Check}

    G -->|< 500ms| K[Score: 100]
    G -->|500-1000ms| L[Score: 75]
    G -->|1000-2000ms| M[Score: 50]
    G -->|> 2000ms| N[Score: 0]

    H -->|> 95%| O[Score: 100]
    H -->|80-95%| P[Score: 75]
    H -->|60-80%| Q[Score: 50]
    H -->|< 60%| R[Score: 0]

    I -->|> 99%| S[Score: 100]
    I -->|90-99%| T[Score: 75]
    I -->|< 90%| U[Score: 50]

    J -->|Connected| V[Score: 100]
    J -->|Disconnected| W[Score: 0]

    K --> X[Calculate Weighted Score]
    L --> X
    M --> X
    N --> X
    O --> X
    P --> X
    Q --> X
    R --> X
    S --> X
    T --> X
    U --> X
    V --> X
    W --> X

    X --> Y{Overall Health}
    Y -->|Score > 80| Z[HEALTHY]
    Y -->|Score 50-80| AA[DEGRADED]
    Y -->|Score < 50| AB[UNHEALTHY]

    AB --> AC[Trigger Reconnection]
    AC --> AD{Exponential Backoff}
    AD -->|Attempt 1| AE[Retry in 1s]
    AD -->|Attempt 2| AF[Retry in 2s]
    AD -->|Attempt 3| AG[Retry in 4s]
    AD -->|Attempt 4| AH[Retry in 8s]
    AD -->|Max Attempts| AI[Mark as Failed]

    style Z fill:#2ecc71,color:#fff
    style AA fill:#f39c12,color:#fff
    style AB fill:#e74c3c,color:#fff
